--- a/assets/logos/README.txt
+++ b/assets/logos/README.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+Yormio landing page logo assets
+
+Copy/rename the following five existing Yormio brand files into this folder:
+
+1. yormio-lockup-primary.png
+   Source: the transparent PRIMARY Yormio horizontal lockup (teal/dark wordmark).
+   Used in: fixed light header.
+
+2. yormio-lockup-mono-light.png
+   Source: the transparent MONO LIGHT / white horizontal Yormio lockup.
+   Used in: dark footer.
+
+3. yormio-symbol-mono-light.png
+   Source: the transparent MONO LIGHT / white Yormio symbol-only mark.
+   Used in: dark Voice Capture feature card.
+
+4. yormio-app-icon-light.png
+   Source: yormio-app-icon-light.png.
+   Used in: favicon, Apple touch icon and privacy/legal card.
+
+5. yormio-app-icon-dark.png
+   Source: yormio-app-icon-dark.png.
+   Used in: dark download CTA section.
+
+Do not use the brand reference board or paywall hero artwork as logo files.
